965399829_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oQrkwEq0P8kQ7kNvwGVwDFr&_nc_oc=Adq3sPkgoV8O2nuBqN1BdO9yehWIooMAwEvJvAW_5k9CEmhxlsc7wMpTvTuZ2eGjXfs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8qpsM-chLo_jmBg8XUMnbrG-nfK9XCO28R8s-9LU-myQ&oe=6A2D7A7A"}, "display_name": "Museverse", "keywords": ["taiko", "music", "drums", "marimba", "learning"], "long_description": "**Transform how you learn music with Museverse \u2013 the immersive VR platform that makes music education fun, accessible, and unforgettable!**\n\n**\ud83c\udfb5 Learn Like Never Before**\n\nExperience bite-sized, gamified lessons. Master rhythm, melody, harmony, and basic instrument skills through interactive VR experiences that keep you engaged and motivated.\n\n**\ud83c\udfb8 Virtual Instruments at Your Fingertips**\n\nNo expensive equipment needed! Play realistic 3D instruments including drums, marimba, and taiko drum. Our instrument-agnostic curriculum teaches universal music concepts you can apply anywhere.\n\n**\ud83c\udfae Gamified Learning That Works**\n\nShort, engaging exercises build your musical awareness step by step. Visual, spatial music theory tasks make complex concepts easy to understand through immersive interaction.\n\n**\ud83c\udfeb Perfect for Schools & Families**\n\n- **Students**: Learn through exploration, not pressure\n- **Educators**: Bring music education into the 21st century\n- **Parents**: Give your children an affordable, safe way to explore music", "short_description": "Learn music through play! Museverse transforms music education with immersive VR lessons and interactive virtual instruments."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.museverse.xyz/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Museverse Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.museverse.xyz/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category